      "commit": {
        "author": "\"svc-ci\" <code@example.com>",
        "date": "2026-09-04T14:27:48-05:00",
        "subject": "fix(controller): adopt hydrator note from first-parent after ours-merge (#1930)",
        "body": "* fix(controller): adopt hydrator note from first-parent after ours-merge\n\nWhen conflict-resolution ours-merge advances the proposed branch tip past\nthe hydrated commit, walk first-parent ancestors for a hydrator note whose\ndrySha matches hydrator.metadata on the tip so downstream gates see\nproposed.note.drySha.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* review\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* int tests\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(git): prefer tip hydrator note before ancestor walk\n\nReturn a git note on the branch tip even when its drySha differs from\nhydrator.metadata, preserving note-only hydrator updates. Walk\nfirst-parent ancestors only when the tip has no note (ours-merge).\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>",
        "sha": "d7eb4979dc0a5be4d354dd2ab643e3422968c0ea",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
  ]
}
